/.agents/

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
next-env.d.ts
/dist/
/.wrangler/
/outputs/
/work/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# 48 MB of generated artwork — 7,988 mask PNGs drawn from this machine's own
# CoreGlyphs.bundle. Deliberately not tracked: they are a pure function of the
# macOS release plus scripts/render_sfsymbols.swift, so `swift
# scripts/render_sfsymbols.swift` reproduces every byte on any Mac. That is the
# same property the whole catalogue story rests on.
#
# Everything else in public/ IS tracked, and the distinction matters: og.png and
# favicon.png are also drawn by that script, but bettermapit.png is not
# reproducible from anything here, and losing the folder wholesale would take it
# with them.
/public/symbols/
